# scaleup_single_switch_8_12800Gbps.topo
# 8-GPU NVLink-class scale-up domain (one DGX-H100-style node): single non-blocking
# crossbar (Podsize==Nodes==Radix_Down => 1 ToR, one hop). Per-host 12800 Gbps = the
# MAX of the intranode-linkspeed sweep, so the swept -intranode_linkspeed governs
# under the fabric ceiling at every point. Degenerate 2-tier encoding (FatTree parser
# rejects Tiers=1). This is the TP=8 scale-up domain that INC accelerates.
Nodes 8
Tiers 2
Podsize 8

Tier 0
Downlink_speed_Gbps 12800
Radix_Down 8
Radix_Up 1
Downlink_Latency_ns 500
Switch_Latency_ns 300
Oversubscribed 8

Tier 1
Downlink_speed_Gbps 12800
Radix_Down 1
Downlink_Latency_ns 500
Switch_Latency_ns 300
